id: hand-to-hand
name: Hand to Hand
order: 1
optionOf: refined-combat
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  When you hit a Studied Opponent with a Physical Attack, you may increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete this Attacking Maneuver.
text: >
  Hand to Hand [Triggered, 1/Round]: When you hit a Studied Opponent with a Physical Attack, you may increase the Wound Roll by 1/2 of your Surgency. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete this Attacking Maneuver.

---

# A Physical Attack that hit one you Studied: asked as its Wound Roll is about to be made, once a Round (chat.mjs answerHit).
[passive]
allow refined.handToHand;
